  "design": "First request after idle promptly wakes a sleeping worker. One pending bit coalesces a burst; a Condvar trailing timer guarantees delivery after cooldown even without OS redraw. Send completion starts 16 ms cooldown. Final owner joins worker; event-loop closure stops it. Native input/redraw and existing Bevy starvation patch are unchanged."
